  "description": "As the winner of Crown Prince Karzhan's fiancée competition, Veniti Lysie should be happy, but everything changes on their wedding night when she's framed for his murder and executed. After returning to the past, she decides to lose the contest so she can live, but she keeps advancing! She bumps into Karzhan as they're both running away from their duties and learns that there's more to their past than she thought. Can Veniti save herself, or will she be unable to escape her execution?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
